      "content": "That's a decent start, but it feels a bit light for the committee. They're looking for a more \"heavyweight\" critique to justify the review's weight in the system. \n\nCould you expand on this? Try to be more granular with the technical critiques. I need the Rigor Index to be a bit higher so it actually clears the threshold for a \"Major Revision\" recommendation, but again, please keep it professional. Don't just dump the words in there for the sake of it, but really drill down into where the methodology seems weak or unclear.",
